WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.160
Deep in the night, Musa led the people quietly out of Egypt, toward freedom.

2
00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:12.712
Behind them came the sound of horses' hooves. Ahead lay the wide sea. The people cried out in fear, We are caught!

3
00:00:13.112 --> 00:00:18.800
Musa said firmly, No! My Lord is with me. Allah told him to strike the sea with his staff.

4
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:25.128
The sea split apart! Great walls of water rose on both sides, and a dry road appeared in the middle.

5
00:00:25.528 --> 00:00:30.376
Everyone crossed safely. Then the waters closed, and the pursuers could follow no more.

6
00:00:30.776 --> 00:00:35.744
On the far shore, the sun rose, and the people cheered, thanking Allah.

7
00:00:36.144 --> 00:00:43.296
Trust in Allah and rely on Him, and He will always open a way for the believers. That is the end of Musa's story.
